{"id":"5b36efa5ca36c7bf","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump.md","title":"n-generic 不可计算于前一有限跳跃","display":"thm-generic-not-lower-jump — n-generic 不可计算于前一有限跳跃","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump","aliases":["20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump"],"display":"thm-generic-not-lower-jump — n-generic 不可计算于前一有限跳跃","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"local-extension","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 6.3.1 的层级扩展；Exercise 6.3.4 的局部推广","source_printed_pages":[137,138],"source_pdf_pages":[171,172],"depends_on":["[[20-df-ngen]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-thm-post]]","[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-not-lower-jump — n-generic 不可计算于前一有限跳跃"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.3.1 的层级扩展；Exercise 6.3.4 的局部推广"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88fbecf58d4e0c66\" href=\"?note=88fbecf58d4e0c66\" title=\"20-df-ngen\">20-df-ngen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a015f8b574fd0061\" href=\"?note=a015f8b574fd0061\" title=\"20-thm-post\">20-thm-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 与其特征集合识别；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\">\\(\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\\)</span> 是有限跳跃迭代。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"88fbecf58d4e0c66\" href=\"?note=88fbecf58d4e0c66\" title=\"20-df-ngen\">20-df-ngen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a015f8b574fd0061\" href=\"?note=a015f8b574fd0061\" title=\"20-thm-post\">20-thm-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic-not-lower-jump}\\vdash\nG\\not\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic-not-lower-jump}\\vdash\nG\\not\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\">\\(G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\\)</span>，不相容串集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)\\ne G(i)]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)\\ne G(i)]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可计算于同一 oracle；Post 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span> 刻画于是给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\Delta_n^0\\subseteq\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\Delta_n^0\\subseteq\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span>。对任意串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，若已经不相容则它自身在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>；否则在下一位补 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-G(|\\tau|)\">\\(1-G(|\\tau|)\\)</span> 就得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的延长，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 稠密。但任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的前缀都不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，且稠密性使任何前缀也不能避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，违反 n-generic 定义。</p>\n<p>该证明包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span>：可计算集合不能为 1-generic。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;1\">\\(n&gt;1\\)</span> 是本目录已采用的 n-generic 定义之本地推广，未冒充原书单独编号的定理。</p>\n<p>来源背景：印刷 137–138 / PDF 171–172；推广证明如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ngen","status":"resolved","id":"88fbecf58d4e0c66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ngen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-post","status":"resolved","id":"a015f8b574fd0061","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-ngen","status":"resolved","id":"88fbecf58d4e0c66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-post","status":"resolved","id":"a015f8b574fd0061","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,n)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n-1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic-not-lower-jump}\\vdash\nG\\not\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"G\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists i<|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)\\ne G(i)]\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\Delta_n^0\\subseteq\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"1-G(|\\tau|)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"n>1","display":false}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"d6bcd07303c88c81","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-thm-1gen-low]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]；see [[20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["88fbecf58d4e0c66","e890b3c29e4a70a3","a015f8b574fd0061","832f53dc90c8947a","755e421576224435"]}